ss=&amp;mdidiansprache=\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noindex nofollow\">Link zur Stiftung</a></li>\n   <li><a href=\"https://www.spk-nbdm.de/content/dam/myif/spk-neubrandenburg-demmin/work/dokumente/spk/ihre-sparkasse/stiftung/formulare/Antrag_auf_Foerderung_NB.pdf?n=true\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noindex nofollow\">Link zum Antrag</a></li>\n  </ul>\n </div>\n</div>";
